# Absolute site URL — used for canonical tags, hreflang alternates, sitemap, and OG metadata.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://stellara.ai

# Optional WhatsApp contact number in international format (digits only, e.g. 15551234567).
# When unset, the floating WhatsApp button is hidden automatically.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=

# --- Integration placeholders (wire the scheduling adapter in lib/appointments.ts) ---
# The appointment flow ships with a local dev adapter that simulates a submission.
# Replace it with a real scheduling/CRM endpoint (Cal.com, Calendly, HubSpot, a lead webhook, etc.).
# LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=
